					"content": "我认为，比起群玉阁，此处的工事更加重要，所以特意过来监督。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110133006
					],
					"speakerTitle": "刻晴"
				},
				{
					"id": 110133006,
					"content": "希望能赶得上…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "刻晴"
				},
				{
					"id": 110133007,
					"content": "这个是？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110133008
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 110133008,
					"content": "这是新式归终机。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110133009
					],
					"speakerTitle": "刻晴"
				},
				{
					"id": 110133009,
					"content": "凝光命专人拆解研究归终机，以此为蓝本设计出了改良图纸。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110133010
					],
					"speakerTitle": "刻晴"
				},
				{
					"id": 110133010,
					"content": "相比仙人制造的原版归终机，这一款的射速与威力都稍逊一筹，但胜在可以量产。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110133011
					],
					"speakerTitle": "刻晴"
				},
				{
					"id": 110133011,
					"content": "而且拆卸和组装都十分方便，可以灵活部署到各个地方。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110133012
					],
					"speakerTitle": "刻晴"
				},
				{
					"id": 110133012,
					"content": "相信它会是应对危机的良策。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
